description	"Azanti Zhug

Half of the Zhug Leadership, Azanti Focused on deception and staying far away from the Zhug Street Combat as possible as he informs and supports from from afar.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Zhug Heavy Blaster Pistol (3)
-- Knocks Back
-- 15%+ Damage, 20%- RoF
-- Mag Reload
- Zhug Dart Pistol
-- Blaster Rifle (1)
-- Tracks / Heals Allies On Hit
-- 60% Less Damage
-- Mag Reload
- Zhug Dart Rifle
-- Projectile Rifle
-- 75% Less Damage
-- Blinds On Enemy Hit / Heals On Ally Hit
-- 2 Shots / Mag Reload
- Disruptor Rifle (3)
-- Mag Reload
- Tracking Flash Grenades (3)
-- Outlines Targets / Flashes on Hit
-- Half Damage

^8Attributes:
- Rally
- Paranoid (Anti Mind Trick 2)
- Zhug Unity (Stat Viewer)
- Personal Stealth Generator (Cloak 1)
- Dexterity (1)
- Healing (2)
- Bounty Board (Tracking Beacon)

^3Abilities:
- Spotter (Enemy Scanner) ^3[CS2]
- Grapple Hook (2) ^3[CS4]
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]
- Confusion Tracking Darts (6) ^3[CS3]
-- Applies Force Focus And Slippery"